    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d873">

                <pb facs="1115" n="1013" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg1013"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">681.003/154: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Diplomatic Agent and Consul General at Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Blake</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-03-01T14:00:00-05:00">March 1, 1935—2
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3. Your despatch 1019, February 6. Department appreciates receiving your
                    observations on formula for recognition of Spanish Zone <pb facs="1116" n="1014"
                        xml:id="pg1014"/> and satisfactory clarification of certain point regarding
                    the claims, and assumes that basic negotiations looking to possible agreement on
                    points (1), (2) and (3) of formula in your 6, January 14, 3 p.m., are being
                    pursued between American Embassy at Madrid and Spanish Foreign Ministry.
                    Department understands further that subsequent to the agreement as outlined
                    above you will begin conversations with Spanish High Commissioner regarding the
                    Kettani claim, and also point (4) of your formula, according to the exigencies
                    of the situation.</p>
                <p>The Department has reiterated to the Embassy its desire to have the claims
                    settled without any conditions other than that the United States shall formally
                    recognize the Spanish Protectorate.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
